 in\n1604.\nThe following works are attributed to a Raṅganātha,\nbut, for the present, it must suffice to enumerate them\nwithout further guarantee.\n Nārāyaṇīya Bīja. Ben. 28. ‘By Nārāyaṇa’ SB.\n257.\n C. on Divākara's Jātakapaddhati. Ben. 26.\n Nisṛṣṭārthadūtī Līlāvatīṭīkā. Ben. 28. But SB.\n256 attributes it to Viśvarūpa.\n Prauḍhamanoramā on Keśvārka's Jātakapaddhati.\nBen. 26. NP. II, 114.\n[]\n Munīśvarīyapāṭīsāra. Ben. 28. Rather by Munī-\nśvara himself.\n Siddhāntacūḍāmaṇi. NP. X, 48.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "रङ्गनाथ son of Bālakṛṣṇa, son of Raṅganātha, son of\nNānabhaṭṭa, nephew of Nārāyaṇa, brother of Veṇī-\nmādhava:\n Vikramorvaśīprakāśikā, written in 1656. Oxf. 135^b.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "रङ्गनाथ son of Nṛsiṃha, the author of the Mitabhāṣiṇī\nLīlāvatīṭīkā, was the brother of the astronomer\nKamalākara, Catal. IO. p. 1007.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "रङ्गनाथ another name of Parāśara Bhaṭṭa (Bhagava-\ndguṇadarpaṇa).", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "रङ्गनाथ and रङ्गराज in works. See also Śrīraṅga.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Kṛṣṇamānasapūjā.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Pitṛmedhavivaraṇa.\n[]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Vāsavadattāṭīkā.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "रङ्गनाथ son of Śrīnivāsa:\n Vivādārthasaṃgrahaṇa vedānta.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "raNgaraja": [{"id": "raNgarAja", "headword": "रङ्गराज", "headword_slp1": "raNgarAja", "fold": "raNgaraja", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "रङ्गनाथ or रङ्गराज son of Devarāja, father of Varada-\nrāja (Mīmāṃsānayavivekadīpikā). Hall p. 180. Burnell\n84^a.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "रङ्गराज 1572--85, patron of Sāyaṇa (Prāyaścittapaddhati).\nBurnell 142^a.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "रङ्गराज probably a previous commentator on Śiśupāla-\nvadha, quoted by Mallinātha on Ś. 2, 8. 6, 48.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Advaitamukhara.", "gloss_langua